.TH ABRAFLEXI-BULKMAIL 1 "2026" "abraflexi-mailer" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
abraflexi-bulkmail \- AbraFlexi Document Mailer component
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B abraflexi-bulkmail
.I template
.RI [ query ]
.RI [ config.env ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B abraflexi-bulkmail
is a component of the abraflexi-mailer package.
It selects recipients from AbraFlexi by the given query and sends
each of them a message rendered from the template.
Every e-mail address is mailed only once.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ABRAFLEXI_BULKMAIL_TEMPLATE
Template file (used when not given as the first argument).
.TP
.B ABRAFLEXI_BULKMAIL_QUERY
Filter of recipients, applied to the selected evidence (used when not given as the second argument).
.TP
.B ABRAFLEXI_BULKMAIL_EVIDENCE
Evidence to select recipients from. Default is
.BR adresar ,
where the address is taken from the primary contact or the address book record.
Other supported evidences are
.BR kontakt ,
.BR osoba ,
.B misto-urceni
(column
.BR email )
and documents such as
.BR faktura-vydana ,
.BR faktura-prijata ,
.BR nabidka-vydana ,
.BR objednavka-prijata
(column
.BR kontaktEmail ).
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
abraflexi-bulkmail template.ftl "mesto='Praha' AND ulice='Nerudova'"
ABRAFLEXI_BULKMAIL_EVIDENCE=faktura-vydana abraflexi-bulkmail template.ftl "kod='VF1-0001/2026'"
.fi
